📋 energy model (exportHbjson / exportDfjson)
  ✅ exportDfjson returns a Dragonfly Model JSON string across the real boundary
  ✅ exportHbjson returns Honeybee JSON bytes across the real boundary
  ✅ exportUsd returns a real Z-up USDA stage (/World, meshes, IFC metadata) with no non-finite coords
  ✅ exportUsd is deterministic (byte-identical across two calls on the same input)
  ✅ exportIfcx stamps the agreed header.ifcxVersion (pins Rust to the TS constant)
  ✅ getPipelineDiagnostics: undefined before load, accumulates across batches, versioned, persists post-load, resets on the next load
  ✅ setEntityIndex resets pipeline diagnostics like a fresh load, and installs a working entity-index cache

📋 geometry-diff hashes + world AABB
  ✅ geometryAabbValues is a Float64Array of exactly 6 values per hashed id
  ✅ geometryAabbValues is in the viewer frame and encloses its own meshes
  ✅ geometryVolumeValues is a Float64Array of exactly one value per hashed id
  ✅ a volume is present exactly where geometryClosureFlags says 0x0F
  ✅ a proved volume never exceeds the volume of its own world box
  ✅ geometryVolumeValues is empty when setComputeGeometryHashes is off
  ✅ geometryAabbValues is empty when setComputeGeometryHashes is off

📋 2D boolean contour sets
  ✅ Contours2D rejects coords that disagree with ringLengths
  ✅ the constructor drops degenerate rings so accessors stay consistent
  ✅ coords/ringLengths round-trip the constructor across the boundary
  ✅ difference2d keeps every disjoint island
  ✅ difference2d punches a hole and reports the holed shape as one region
  ✅ intersection2d clips to the shared region
  ✅ an empty operand has a defined answer, not a crash
  ✅ Contours2D.fromMeshOutline feeds a real meshOutline2d result into a boolean
  ✅ operations return new handles and leave their operands usable
  ✅ splitMeshByZones cuts a wall at a known fraction and the pieces add up
  ✅ splitMeshByZones keeps an element no zone reaches, as the remainder
  ✅ splitMeshByZones cuts by a prism footprint, not by its bounding box

📋 prepass class column (wasm <-> host)
  ✅ scanEntityIndexShard delivers a Uint8Array class column aligned to the ids
  ✅ every named prepass class reaches the host on the right record
  ✅ a FLAG bit survives the wasm->host hop as an unsigned byte
  ✅ no host-consumed code arrives flagged yet (the #2088 trigger)
  ✅ the #1910 representation exception never flags a NAMED code
  ✅ the real host span extractor reads the real class column
  ✅ a flagged class column still lands in the right host span list
  ✅ a flagged class column crosses back into wasm without changing discovery

📋 #3395 refusal count (wasm <-> host)
  ✅ scanEntityIndexShard hands back refusal OFFSETS, not a count
  ✅ a file declaring nothing oversized yields no offsets from a shard at 0
  ✅ a shard starting inside a quoted value refuses text the file never declared
[ifc-lite] scan: skipped 1 record(s) with an express id above 4294967295 (#3395)
  ✅ the serial pre-pass entity-index event carries oversizedIdCount

📋 #5409 class-toggled classes stay off the instanced shard
