📋 EDGE-WASM-5 multi-colour mapped sources keep their palette on the don't-bake path
  ✅ control: a uniform-palette repeated source instances (the fixture reaches don't-bake)
  ✅ every occurrence of a multi-colour repeated source renders flat with both palette colours

